      ],
      "description": "The Tanfust design system as one install: zinc palette, 0.625rem radius, Geist Sans for text, Geist Mono for headings and labels, inverted bold menus, and the @tanfust registry pre-registered in components.json. Works with Radix or Base UI — it does not pin a primitive library.",
